# Node — deploy tooling only (Phase 18).
# The `railway` package exists solely to evaluate .railway/railway.ts when running
# `railway config plan/apply` from a developer machine. It is NOT part of the
# application and NOT part of the build: Railpack detects Python before Node
# (pyproject.toml wins), so package.json is inert at build time and nothing here is
# ever served to a browser. CLAUDE.md §2's no-build-step rule for the frontend stands.
node_modules/
